{"v":[[1,"Deliver me, O Lord, from the evil man: preserve me from the violent man;"],[2,"Which imagine mischiefs in their heart; continually are they gathered together for war."],[3,"They have sharpened their tongues like a serpent; adders’ poison is under their lips. Selah."],[4,"Keep me, O Lord, from the hands of the wicked; preserve me from the violent man; who have purposed to overthrow my goings."],[5,"The proud have hid a snare for me, and cords; they have spread a net by the wayside; they have set gins for me. Selah."],[6,"I said unto the Lord, Thou art my God: hear the voice of my supplications, O Lord."],[7,"O God the Lord, the strength of my salvation, thou hast covered my head in the day of battle."],[8,"Grant not, O Lord, the desires of the wicked: further not his wicked device; lest they exalt themselves. Selah."],[9,"As for the head of those that compass me about, let the mischief of their own lips cover them."],[10,"Let burning coals fall upon them: let them be cast into the fire; into deep pits, that they rise not up again."],[11,"Let not an evil speaker be established in the earth: evil shall hunt the violent man to overthrow him."],[12,"I know that the Lord will maintain the cause of the afflicted, and the right of the poor."],[13,"Surely the righteous shall give thanks unto thy name: the upright shall dwell in thy presence."]],"w":{"1":[["chaletze-ni","rescue me","H2502"],["yahweh","O Yahweh","H3068"],["me-'adam","from a man","H120"],["ra'","evil","H7451"],["me-'ish","from a man of","H376"],["chamasim","violence<s>","H2555"],["tintzere-ni","you will preserve me","H5341"]],"2":[["'asher","[those] who","H834"],["chashevu","they plan","H2803"],["ra'ot","evil things","H7451"],["be-lev","in [the] heart","H3820"],["kol","every","H3605"],["yom","day","H3117"],["yaguru","they stir up trouble","H1481"],["milchamot","wars","H4421"]],"3":[["shananu","they sharpen","H8150"],["leshona-m","tongue their","H3956"],["kemov","like","H3644"],["nachash","a snake","H5